concept_negotiation_desc:
$concept_negotiate$ with an [concept_interest_group] during [Concept('concept_enactment_of_laws', '$concept_enactment_of_laws_enactment$')] to convince them to change their stance on the currently $concept_enactment_of_laws_enacting$ [concept_law]. An $concept_interest_group_possessive$ willingness to $concept_negotiate$ is determined by their [concept_amenability]. The higher $concept_amenability$ they have the friendlier and more willing they will be to $concept_negotiate$.

@indifferent! [Concept('concept_endorse_oppose', '$concept_indifferent$')] $concept_interest_groups$ must be @in_government! [concept_in_government] to be $concept_negotiated$ with while @disapproves! [Concept('concept_endorse_oppose', '$concept_opposing$')] $concept_interest_groups$ can be $concept_negotiated$ with when [concept_in_opposition].

Convincing an $concept_interest_group$ to move from @disapproves! $concept_opposing$ to @indifferent! $concept_indifferent$ can be just as effective has convincing them to move from @indifferent! [Concept('concept_endorse_oppose', '$concept_indifferent$')] to @approves! [Concept('concept_endorse_oppose', '$concept_endorsing$')].

je_meiji_restoration_reason:
The opening of #v $JAP$#! has unleashed forces beyond the control of the ruling #b Shogunate#!. Enraged by the encroachment of predatory foreign powers, militants of the [SelectLocalization(SCOPE.sPoliticalMovement('meiji_movement_scope').IsValid, SCOPE.sPoliticalMovement('meiji_movement_scope').GetName, 'movement_meiji_restorationist_name')] demand the deposition of the $RULER_TITLE_SHOGUN$, restoration of the power of the #b $RULER_TITLE_EMPEROR$#!, and the expulsion of foreigners. All the while, ambitious [SCOPE.gsInterestGroup('daimyo_ig').GetName] seek to use the weakness of the Shogunate to advance their own interests.

If Japan is to find a place in the world, she must realize the reform necessary to defend herself, and settle the conflict between her de jure and de facto sovereigns. Whether alone or alongside the Shōgun, the Emperor must rule.

@warning! As the [Concept('concept_activism', '$concept_activism_short$')] of the [SelectLocalization(SCOPE.sPoliticalMovement('meiji_movement_scope').IsValid, SCOPE.sPoliticalMovement('meiji_movement_scope').GetName, 'movement_meiji_restorationist_name')] increases, factions loyal to the Imperial Court will seek more forceful means to restore the Emperor.

je_peru_bolivia_reason:
The Bolivian intervention into the Peruvian civil war of 1835 has led to the territories of Peru falling under the control of the [SCOPE.sCountry('bolivia_scope').GetRuler.GetPrimaryRoleTitle] of [SCOPE.sCountry('bolivia_scope').GetName]. [SCOPE.sCountry('bolivia_scope').GetNameNoFormatting] seeks to preserve this fragile Confederation, so that a true and complete union between her subjects might become possible.

@information! The ambitions of the #bold Peru-Bolivian Confederation#! can be averted by forcing them to release their [Concept('concept_subject', '$concept_subjects$')] before the Progress Bar reaches #variable 100%#!.

@warning! Whilst #b $BOL$#! seek to consolidate the #bold Confederation#!'s rule, she will be subject to increased aggression from her neighbors.

