je_india_nationalism_britain_reason:
Across the [SCOPE.sCountry('india_scope').GetName], national consciousness is rising amongst the native Indian population. Native Indians educated in [SCOPE.sCountry('overlord_scope').GetAdjectiveNoFlag] schools and employed by the colonial government have begun to agitate for equal status within imperial institutions, greater economic opportunity, and self-governance for India.

Whilst this [concept_journal_entry] is active, the [SCOPE.sCountry('india_scope').GetAdjective] national movement will have the opportunity to petition us for greater autonomy and other local reforms. The repercussions for denying these petitions are dependent upon the status of the #bold progress bar#!.

@warning! If the [Concept('concept_activism','$concept_activism_short$')] of the Indian national movement gets too high, the movement will shift its focus towards #bold full independence#!.

